  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Do not try to decide your entire specialisation this week.
  </p>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      Start with Google Ads and GA4 certifications since they build directly on your existing numeric
      strength, then build one small practice campaign or dashboard within the same stretch of time.
    </p>
    <p>
      Run the decision through The 4-Checkpoint Protocol above, then pass The 3 Gates before you commit
      a longer stretch of learning time to a specific lane.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    A digital marketing career for commerce students in India works best when you treat your degree as
    a real head start on the numbers side, not the whole plan by itself. Moving toward earlier financial
    freedom from here comes down to the same thing it always does: the right lane for your actual
    strengths, one piece of visible proof, and a clear read on where the real high-income opportunities
    in this field sit before you commit months of learning time. Move toward the specific lane
